  "root_cause": "The subnet NSG on the AKS subnet had no inbound rule for the foundry-router load balancer, so DenyAllInBound dropped Foundry's calls to <router-ip>:443. The AKS-managed NIC NSG already allowed AzureCloud to that address; the load-balancer rule uses floating IP, so both NSGs evaluate the frontend address.",
